  "stageId": "act11d0_st01",
  "title": "老櫟樹下",
  "storyCode": "TW-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f94d5618f1822091b0413146dff5085f0a912a7422cde46b5ab93a59da9635a7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 纯剧情AVG序章"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3:23 P.M.    天氣/晴\n萊塔尼亞境內，移動城鎮沃倫姆德外，一棵微不足道的老櫟樹下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林長官......這已經是您今天的第三包煙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉，伯父......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有依賴煙草的必要。當然，煙草和酒精都是壞東西......你說的對，別學我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但您的咳嗽越來越嚴重了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒必要這麼畢恭畢敬，現在不是工作時間，我和你說過......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他望向遠處，燒毀的帳篷，肆意生長的野草，他抖了抖煙灰。\n他本想在獨處的時候獲得一些安寧，即使只是透過一個稱謂的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......他們讓你跑這一趟，他們竟然讓你來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一群老滑頭，他們不敢親自來找我提意見也就罷了，他們還要傷害一個小姑娘——咳咳、咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯父，別激動！是我自願的，是我想著至少要親自告訴伯父......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——咳咳，咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您真的得戒掉煙酒了，您最近的狀態很差......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果我大概已經猜得到了——該死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，會上討論得很激烈。不過年輕人都躲在待客室裡，誰也不敢發話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們、他們沒有人幫我，對不起，只靠我說服不了其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......自從城鎮偏離航線之後情況就緊張了起來。現在不是搞社會實踐的時候，學生和年輕人就算發表意見也沒人會聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎮民代表一致認為，因為無法分辨感染者以及他們的感染情況，為了避免意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屍體必須埋葬在小鎮之外，當然也......不允許舉辦葬禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我很抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但他們中有人是沃倫姆德的一員，是我們的家人，我們不應該這麼簡單就拋棄他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃克哈德是最好的裁縫，他接過他爹的裁縫店後，鎮上幾乎每一次婚禮都少不了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢德曼是個可憐人，因為大裂谷的事他丟了天災信使的工作，但他在努力贖罪。他很堅強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱文不是感染者，他為了他的妻子盡心盡力，他本來是個好丈夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有托爾瓦爾德，他——咳咳，咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不該再抽煙了，長官。托爾也這麼說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你接受嗎，孩子？實話實說，別管那些老滑頭的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我只想托爾能入土為安，而不是在死後還要被當做危險品......被小心翼翼地處理，被風吹雨打......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼我們要這麼對待他們？過去，過去不是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有那位礦石病醫生。她很了不起，沒有拋棄沃倫姆德，這四個人都有權利得到體面的下葬，但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因為感染者和他們一起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......該責怪的是這場火災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......但是這件事得延後，現在還不能拋棄他們的遺體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聯繫了最近的憲兵隊，他們會在救援隊裡增派專業人士協助調查，在那之前，屍體都得保存在我照顧得到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有專門人士在，我們就可以更合理地對待死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近？我們還能得到救援......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“最近”。他們可能要一個月——視那條裂縫的具體長度，可能要好幾個月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沃倫姆德在脫離原本航線以後情況一天比一天糟糕，大家都說我們得繞過大裂谷往回走，回到正常的航線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過越過大裂谷要繞的路也太遠了，拖得時間太久的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......總之，先等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我和托爾多待一會，我......我有這個權利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果那些老滑頭要把我的孩子扔在沃倫姆德之外的荒郊野嶺上，就讓他們對著他們的士官長開火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對著我，開火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會的！大家都清楚您對城鎮的付出，不至於......不至於的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，忘了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這種情況下，我不能說這種話......士官長不能說這種話。我們應該公事公辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可托爾畢竟是您的兒子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔佳娜，你回去告訴他們吧。就說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就說我同意了、咳、我同意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，咳咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstrongpoint"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長，他們回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多虧了這些本地人，我們才能混進附近的城鎮裡補充資源......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "獵人小隊也快回來了，但願今天能有所收穫。我已經吃了兩天沙蟲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......水源呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題。也多虧了那些傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不過說真的，我和他們不是很聊得來。總覺得會被他們小瞧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看樣子沃倫姆德近期就打算重新開始遷移，我們必須在那之前得到一個結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們有幫手，會有個好結果的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫手嗎......也許吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我信不過這些本地人，這些感染者......他們只是單純的想要報復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞對待感染者的態度溫和得多，既然源石技藝普及率如此之高，這些感染者有什麼理由被畏懼被迫害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而事實上，在這裡的感染者至少還能物盡其用，不用被立刻送上絞刑架，這還不夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看他們只是一群別有用意的暴徒，想利用我們的名號——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名號？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......名號，又算什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不信任......這沒問題，所以......那我們要信任誰？該信任誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別老是說這麼嚇人的話啊，我當然聽你的，隊長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，有落葉，落在你頭上了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾箱乾肉，撿來的水果，水源。現在是初秋，離入冬還有很久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們還有時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧，你講話還是這麼讓人摸不著頭腦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，我們什麼時候上戰場，你說了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰場？不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看吧，獵人們回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎今晚的伙食會好一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但願吧。趁現在多吃點肉，入冬之後，我們的伙食會成為大問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鮑勃有回信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自從我們進入萊塔尼亞境內之後就再也沒有他們的消息了......呃，還有，我一直有個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他到底是代號“鮑勃”，因為個頭很大所以叫“大鮑勃”，還是他一開始就叫“大鮑勃”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......記不得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武裝的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，反正他們本來就是賞金獵人，說不定已經找到寶藏了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......寶藏，寶藏啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，如果也有寶藏可以幫幫我們......就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經二十七天了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那傢伙怎麼可能拖了這麼久沒有聯絡，她可是個出了名的守時狂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托......你在哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞葉姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，麗薩......不，現在該叫你鈴蘭幹員了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是個不錯的代號喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，謝謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞葉姐姐守著通訊室已經二十個小時了，不休息一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有......這麼久了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！所以去休息室睡一會吧，我會幫姐姐看著的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧......真的已經這麼久了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還是沒有安托姐姐的消息嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......但我已經提出去萊塔尼亞的申請了。如果阿米婭答應的話，我隨時出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去萊塔尼亞？亞葉姐姐還有其他任務要處理吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是我的同學，也是我最好的朋友，我不會......也不能放著她不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托最後一次定期聯絡是在萊塔尼亞北部的辦事處，除非有什麼特殊情況，她不該離開辦事處太遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那我也要去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒！？這麼乾脆嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只、只是去調查一下安托姐姐的下落，不會有什麼危險吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "視情況，也不一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的！我也是正式幹員，我也是凱爾希醫生的學生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且亞葉姐姐總是愁眉苦臉的，這怎麼行！我不放心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉，沒想到有一天會被小麗薩擔心，最近是不是有點太不在狀態了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煩惱這種事情不分年齡大小啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒，好吧！反正我也向本地的分部打了報告，真有什麼意外，他們也會幫我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等阿米婭同意之後，我們一起去，但是你要時刻和我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即時通訊？是安托姐姐回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。是一份簡報，是萊塔尼亞的幹員收到通訊後發來的簡報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞葉姐姐......?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托最後出現在萊塔尼亞當地的某個城鎮......而那裡在一個月前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遭遇了天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
